  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FoodTechBangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Project is to strengthen the collaboration between the Netherlands and Bangladesh in the field of aquaculture in general and the commercial positioning of the Parties in the aquaculture sector in Bangladesh in specific. In parallel, the Project aims to contribute to improving the technical performance of fish and shrimp breeders and farmers in Bangladesh by demonstrating best practices and transferring know-how.</narrative>
  </description>
